@release_notes(changes: list[str]) -> list[str]:
  > system:
    Classify the meaning of the supplied changelog text.
    Do not verify whether the product exists or whether the change was deployed.
  [notes: list[str]] = `[]`

  > loop [change]: `changes`:
    > if: The text "<change>" describes a user-visible change rather than internal-only maintenance
      >> Describe this change for a user, not an implementer: <change>
      Keep exact limits and platform restrictions; do not invent benefits.
      The one-sentence release note is [note: str].

      [notes] := `notes + [note]`

  = `notes`

= ```
return release_notes([
    "CSV exports now preserve non-ASCII customer names instead of replacing them with question marks.",
    "Renamed an internal test fixture; no runtime or user-visible behavior changed.",
    "On Linux only, uploads can now be resumed after a lost connection for files up to 100 MB.",
])
```
